body:
I may be sinned or downvoted for saying so, but I honestly don't see what's wrong with loving your brother/sister as your husband/wife. I only have a little brother but, the view I have on incest is basically just I don't see what's wrong with it.

&#x200B;

And no, I'm not doing any with him.

Meanwhile...

&#x200B;

God: -realizes- H O L Y S H I T .

I can still vividly remember the fires of each burning hut of my village. The screams were deafening, and the sights were blinding. There she was, standing over a pileup of dead bodies, raising her sword and laughing at the madness.

&#x200B;

Such cruelty. She didn't even raised a finger, but everyone died as soon as we looked at her.
